# TypeScript

## Typing

- Explicit types for component props and hook return values
- Types for Event Loop state: `Phase`, `Task`, `PhaseState` — in separate `types/` or next to logic

## Examples

```ts
// ✅ Types for Event Loop domain
type Phase = "timers" | "pending" | "poll" | "check" | "close";
interface Task {
  id: string;
  source: "setTimeout" | "setImmediate" | "nextTick" | "promise" | "io";
  label?: string;
}
```

- Avoid `any` — use `unknown` and type guards when needed
- Strict mode: `strict: true` in tsconfig
